  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s \"Freedom Isn't Free\" T-Shirt proudly displays a horizontal US flag with the poignant phrase \"Freedom Isn't Free\" atop, featuring a kneeling soldier silhouette within the flag. Its reverse distressed US flag graphic on the right sleeve adds a vintage touch. Crafted from a comfortable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend, this short sleeve shirt offers lightweight wear perfect for various occasions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132901",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s \"Freedom Isn't Free\" T-Shirt proudly displays a horizontal US flag with the poignant phrase \"Freedom Isn't Free\" atop, featuring a kneeling soldier silhouette within the flag. Its reverse distressed US flag graphic on the right sleeve adds a vintage touch. Crafted from a comfortable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend, this short sleeve shirt offers lightweight wear perfect for various occasions. The tag-less printed label enhances comfort. This t-shirt is ideal for holidays like Veteran's Day, Memorial Day, and 4th of July, and is great for going to the gym or everyday wear. Pair your graphic tee with our BDU Cargo Shorts and Tactical Operator Cap.</p>",
